1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,920
In my recent videos, I've talked about universal truths of great performance.

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:18,240
Specifically, truth number six, well-being drives performance.

3
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:25,520
Today, I will show you the linkage between well-being and performance.

4
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,440
But first, click like and subscribe.

5
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:37,840
For most people, well-being and performance reside in two different compartments of their brain.

6
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:48,560
Well-being is the soft and nice touchy feely stuff that we normally put in our employees benefits packages.

7
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:56,720
Like access to mindfulness apps, yoga sessions, gym memberships, access to therapists.

8
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,560
